Dear Extension Colleagues,

Registration is now open for the 2027 NC Extension Annual Conference!

Dates: March 15-17, 2027
Location: Raleigh Convention Center, Raleigh NC
Theme: "Bridging Communities: Extension in the 21st Century"

Highlights:
- Keynote by Dr. Monica Rainge, USDA Deputy Assistant Secretary for Civil Rights
- 45 breakout sessions across 8 tracks
- Poster session (abstract deadline: January 15, 2027)
- Networking reception with NC Commissioner of Agriculture

Early bird registration: $175 (through December 31, 2026)
Regular registration: $225 (January 1 - February 28, 2027)

Track highlights relevant to your work:
- Track 3: Culturally Responsive Programming
- Track 5: Small Farm Sustainability
- Track 7: Community Partnerships

Register at: conference.ncextension.org

Questions? conference@ncextension.org

See you in Raleigh!
NC Extension Conference Planning Committee
